    title: "Yandex資料中心遭烏克蘭無人機攻擊 服務中斷影響雲端運算與多項網路服務",
    summary: "俄羅斯大型網路服務提供商 Yandex 的多座資料中心，在一段時間內接連遭到烏克蘭無人機的攻擊。根據報導，這些攻擊發生在 10 月 7 日至 8 日深夜、10 月 9 日以及 10 月 11 日，目標分別是位於梁贊州、卡盧加州和弗拉基米爾州的資料中心。攻擊導致其中兩座設施完全關閉，另一座基礎設施也受損。Yandex Cloud 官方公告指出，部分服務區域目前仍無法正常運作，影響範圍涵蓋雲端運算、儲存、託管資料庫、搜尋等核心服務，連帶波及依賴 Yandex 基礎設施的運輸、媒體等第三方產業的服務。事件的發生背景，被烏克蘭方面描述為對俄羅斯先前攻擊的報復。目前，俄羅斯數位發展部正與國防部協調，以強化資料中心的防護措施，並由其他俄羅斯雲端業者協助 Yandex 進行服務的加速復原。",
    tags: ["Yandex", "資料中心", "烏克蘭無人機攻擊", "雲端服務中斷", "俄羅斯基礎設施", "網路服務提供商"],
    title_en: "Yandex Data Centers Targeted by Ukrainian Drone Attacks, Disrupting Cloud Computing and Multiple Online Services",
    summary_en: "Multiple data centers belonging to Yandex, a major Russian online service provider, were successively attacked by Ukrainian drones over a period of time. According to reports, these attacks occurred on the nights of October 7-8, October 9, and October 11, targeting data centers located in Ryazan, Kaluga, and Vladimir regions. The attacks resulted in the complete shutdown of two facilities, while another facility was damaged. Yandex Cloud's official announcement stated that certain service areas are still unable to operate normally, affecting core services including cloud computing, storage, hosted databases, and search. This disruption also impacted third-party industries such as transportation and media that rely on Yandex's infrastructure. The background of the incident was described by Ukrainian sources as retaliation for previous Russian attacks. Currently, the Russian Ministry of Digital Development is coordinating with the Ministry of Defense to strengthen data center protective measures, and other Russian cloud providers are assisting Yandex with accelerated service recovery.",
