    title: "WhatsApp 新增功能：非帳號用戶可透過連結加入通話，擴大溝通範圍",
    summary: "WhatsApp 宣布推出重大功能更新，允許沒有 WhatsApp 帳號的外部用戶，透過分享的專用連結加入通話。此功能透過網頁瀏覽器實現，適用於一對一或最多 32 人的群組通話。即使是透過連結加入的「賓客」（Guests），其通話仍維持端對端加密，並保留了舉手、螢幕分享等核心功能。主辦方（Host）需具備 WhatsApp 帳號才能建立通話連結。用戶只需在 WhatsApp 的通話頁面建立連結，並將其分享給目標對象。未來此功能預計將整合至 Google Calendar 和 Outlook，透過 WhatsApp 插件提供更便利的使用體驗。此更新旨在讓更多非 WhatsApp 使用者也能輕鬆參與通訊，擴大了 WhatsApp 的使用邊界。",
    tags: ["WhatsApp", "通訊軟體", "通話功能", "跨平台", "Google Calendar", "Outlook"],
    title_en: "WhatsApp Adds Feature: Non-Account Users Can Join Calls Via Link, Expanding Communication Reach",
    summary_en: "WhatsApp has announced a major feature update that allows external users without a WhatsApp account to join calls via a shared dedicated link. This functionality is implemented through a web browser and supports both one-on-one and group calls of up to 32 people. Even 'Guests' who join via a link maintain end-to-end encryption and retain core features such as raising hands and screen sharing. The host must have a WhatsApp account to create the call link. Users simply generate the link within the WhatsApp call page and share it with the intended recipients. This feature is planned to be integrated with Google Calendar and Outlook in the future, offering a more seamless user experience through WhatsApp plugins. This update aims to allow more non-WhatsApp users to easily participate in communications, thereby expanding WhatsApp's user base.",
