    category: "重點關注",
    title: "Apple 股價突破 5 兆美元市值，受惠於新產品線與市場信心",
    summary: "本文報導 Apple 的股價在當日收盤時，首次成功維持在 5 兆美元以上的市值門檻。這項里程碑發生在科技股普遍下跌的市場環境中，與 NVIDIA 等主要科技公司股價下跌形成對比。Apple 的股價上漲，推動其市值達到 5.01 兆美元。報導指出，這次的市值突破是在一系列重大產品發表之後，包括 iPhone 18 Pro 系列、iPhone Duo、Apple HomeView、HomePod mini 2 和 Apple TV 4K 等新產品的發布帶動的。此外，這也為公司即將於 11 月 2 日公布的財年第四季財報，提供了積極的市場預期。整體而言，這顯示了投資者對 Apple 在新領導層（自 9 月 1 日接任 CEO 的 John Ternus）指導下，對抗成本上升和硬體價格上漲的信心。",
    tags: ["Apple", "市值", "iPhone 18 Pro", "Apple HomeView", "科技股"],
    title_en: "Apple Stock Price Breaks Through $5 Trillion Market Cap, Driven by New Product Lines and Market Confidence",
    summary_en: "This article reports that Apple's stock price successfully maintained a market capitalization above the $5 trillion threshold at the close of the day. This milestone occurred in a market environment where technology stocks were generally declining, contrasting with the fall in stock prices of major tech companies like NVIDIA. Apple's stock increase propelled its market cap to $5.01 trillion. The report indicates that this market cap breakthrough was driven by a series of major product announcements, including the iPhone 18 Pro series, iPhone Duo, Apple HomeView, HomePod mini 2, and Apple TV 4K. Furthermore, this has created positive market expectations ahead of the company's financial report for the fourth quarter, scheduled for release on November 2. Overall, this demonstrates investor confidence in Apple's ability to combat rising costs and hardware price increases under the leadership of its new CEO, John Ternus, who took office on September 1.",
    tags_en: ["Apple", "Market Cap", "iPhone 18 Pro", "Apple HomeView", "Tech Stocks"],
    sources: [
      { name: "9to5Mac", url: "https://9to5mac.com/2026/10/14/apple-just-closed-the-day-above-5-trillion-for-the-first-time", lang: "EN" }
    ]
