    category: "重點關注",
    title: "OpenAI指控前員工轉交高度機密設備文件給Apple，但Apple否認相關指控",
    summary: "OpenAI透過新的法律文件聲稱，一位離職的員工在轉職至Apple後，將「超過百份關於至少一款未發布OpenAI設備的高度機密文件」傳輸到其個人帳戶。然而，Apple已向路透社回應，表示尚未發現任何支持OpenAI這些指控的證據。此事件涉及兩大科技巨頭之間的知識產權爭議，核心爭議點是員工是否洩露了OpenAI的未公開設備設計與技術文件。目前雙方尚未有進一步的法律裁定，相關資訊仍持續關注。",
    tags: ["OpenAI", "Apple", "知識產權", "員工洩密", "未公開設備"],
    title_en: "OpenAI Accuses Former Employee of Transferring Highly Confidential Equipment Documents to Apple; Apple Denies Allegations",
    summary_en: "OpenAI claims, through new legal filings, that a former employee transferred 'over a hundred highly confidential documents regarding at least one unreleased OpenAI device' to their personal account after moving to Apple. However, Apple responded to Reuters, stating that it has not found any evidence to support OpenAI's allegations. This incident involves an intellectual property dispute between two tech giants, with the core dispute centering on whether an employee leaked OpenAI's unpublished device designs and technical documents. As of now, neither party has made any further legal determinations, and related information remains under close scrutiny.",
