    id: "20261014-16142",
    trackers: ["os"],
    category: "重點關注",
    title: "KPMG高層升職與裁員並行引發員工不滿：科技與數據部門面臨重組",
    summary: "本文報導KPMG內部發生大規模人員重組事件。在科技與數據部門（Tech and Data）面臨裁員潮的背景下，部門主管Paul Henninger宣布自己被晉升為集團諮詢部門主管，負責推動諮詢業務、加速AI能力，並發展專業的銷售與技術路徑。然而，此消息的發布時間點，與KPMG於10月9日通知部分員工（約佔部門的4%）面臨裁員，以及部分員工被告知在聖誕節前失業，形成了極大的反差。被裁員工對於公司提供的遣散費（僅100英鎊，且要求放棄法律權益）感到極度不滿，認為公司在處理員工變動時缺乏同理心。儘管KPMG宣稱公司業務持續增長，並強調對人才的投資，但內部人士指出，這種「晉升與裁員並行」的行為，嚴重侵蝕了企業倫理，引發了員工群體的強烈不滿。",
    tags: ["KPMG", "Paul Henninger", "AI", "人員重組", "企業倫理", "科技與數據"],
    title_en: "KPMG's Simultaneous Promotions and Layoffs Spark Employee Dissatisfaction: Tech and Data Division Faces Restructuring",
    summary_en: "This article reports on a large-scale internal restructuring event at KPMG. Against the backdrop of layoffs in the Tech and Data division, the division head, Paul Henninger, announced his promotion to lead the Group Advisory practice. In this new role, he will be responsible for driving advisory business, accelerating AI capabilities, and developing specialized sales and technical pathways. However, the timing of this announcement created a stark contrast with KPMG's notification on October 9th that certain employees (approximately 4% of the division) were facing layoffs, and that other employees were informed of job loss before Christmas. The laid-off employees expressed extreme dissatisfaction with the severance package offered (only £100, and requiring the waiver of legal rights), believing the company lacked empathy in handling employee changes. Despite KPMG claiming continued business growth and emphasizing investment in talent, internal sources point out that this 'simultaneous promotion and layoff' action severely erodes corporate ethics, triggering strong dissatisfaction among the employee base.",
    tags_en: ["KPMG", "Paul Henninger", "AI", "Restructuring", "Corporate Ethics", "Tech and Data"],
    sources: [
      { name: "The Register", url: "https://theregister.com/channel/2026/10/14/kpmg-tech-and-data-boss-tells-staff-facing-the-boot-hes-getting-promoted/5302761", lang: "EN" }
    ]
