    title: "시큐아이 (SECUI) 品牌更名與新 CI 發布，強化全球市場的智能安全定位",
    summary: "資安公司시큐아이（SECUI）於近日宣布更換英文公司名稱，由原來的「SECUI」變更為「SECUi」。此舉旨在提高品牌發音的辨識度，並提升其在全球市場的品牌競爭力。新的品牌識別（CI）設計，將原名稱末尾的大寫字母「I」改為小寫「i」，同時強調了「Intelligence」（智能）的價值。新標誌以「監視者的眼睛」和「盾牌」為設計靈感，象徵著偵測隱形威脅的智能安全能力，以及保護客戶環境的堅固安全體系。透過此次品牌重塑，시큐아이計畫以「Full-Stack」的整合安全能力，涵蓋從網路、雲端到安全服務，積極進軍全球市場。",
    tags: ["시큐아이", "SECUI", "品牌重塑", "智能安全", "Full-Stack", "資安"],
    title_en: "SECUI Rebrands and Launches New CI, Strengthening Intelligent Security Positioning in Global Markets",
    summary_en: "Cybersecurity company SECUI recently announced a change to its English corporate name, transitioning from the original 'SECUI' to 'SECUi'. This move aims to improve brand pronunciation recognition and boost its brand competitiveness in the global market. The new Corporate Identity (CI) design changes the uppercase 'I' at the end of the original name to a lowercase 'i', while emphasizing the value of 'Intelligence'. The new logo is inspired by the 'Eye of the Watcher' and the 'Shield', symbolizing intelligent security capabilities to detect invisible threats, and a robust security system to protect client environments. Through this brand overhaul, SECUI plans to actively enter the global market with 'Full-Stack' integrated security capabilities, covering everything from networking and cloud to security services.",
    tags_en: ["SECUI", "Rebranding", "Intelligent Security", "Full-Stack", "Cybersecurity"],
